{"week":"8","q":"What does the brown loop in the circular flow diagram represent?","opts":["The flow of money","The flow of real commodities","The flow of taxes","The flow of imports"],"a":0,"why":"The brown loop represents the flow of money from households to firms for the purchase of goods and services, and from firms to households for the purchase of factors of production."},
